":"ஆகும்","lemma":"ākum","gloss":"will become"}],"gloss":"will become"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கிளையுடை","parts":[{"text":"கிளை","lemma":"kiḷai","gloss":"kin"},{"text":"உடை","lemma":"uṭai","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having kin"},{"surface":"மாந்தர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"மாந்தர்","lemma":"māntar","gloss":"people"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"ku","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the people"},{"surface":"புணையும்","parts":[{"text":"புணை","lemma":"puṇai","gloss":"support"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"a support also"},{"surface":"ஆம்","parts":[{"text":"ஆம்","lemma":"ām","gloss":"will be"}],"gloss":"will be"},{"surface":"இவ்","parts":[{"text":"இவ்","lemma":"ihtu","gloss":"this"}],"gloss":"this"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"eṉa","gloss":"thus"}],"gloss":"thus"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"āṅku","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"அறிந்திசின்","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"aṟi","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ந்த்","lemma":"t","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"இசின்","lemma":"iciṉ","gloss":"expletive suffix"}],"gloss":"I knew"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"tōḻi","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend"},{"surface":"வேங்கை","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கை","lemma":"vēṅkai","gloss":"Kino tree"}],"gloss":"Kino tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வீயா","parts":[{"text":"வீ","lemma":"vī","gloss":"perish"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"negative relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"unfailing"},{"surface":"மென்சினை","parts":[{"text":"மென்சினை","lemma":"மென்சினை","gloss":"soft branch"}],"gloss":"soft branch","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வீ","parts":[{"text":"வீ","lemma":"vī","gloss":"blossom"}],"gloss":"blossoms"},{"surface":"உக","parts":[{"text":"உக","lemma":"உக","gloss":"to shed"}],"gloss":"to shed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆர்","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்","lemma":"ār","gloss":"full"}],"gloss":"deep"},{"surface":"துயில்","parts":[{"text":"துயில்","lemma":"tuyil","gloss":"sleep"}],"gloss":"sleep"},{"surface":"இயம்பு","parts":[{"text":"இயம்பு","lemma":"iyampu","gloss":"to sound/snore"}],"gloss":"snoring"},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"nāṭu","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"he of"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மார்பு","parts":[{"text":"மார்பு","lemma":"mārpu","gloss":"chest"}],"gloss":"chest"},{"surface":"உரித்து","parts":[{"text":"உரிமை","lemma":"urimai","gloss":"right"},{"text":"து","lemma":"tu","gloss":"it"}],"gloss":"rightful"},{"surface":"ஆகிய","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"āku","gloss":"become"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"iya","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"which became"},{"surface":"மறு","parts":[{"text":"மறு","lemma":"maṟu","gloss":"blemish"}],"gloss":"blemish"},{"surface":"இல்","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"il","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without"},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பு","lemma":"naṭpu","gloss":"friendship"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"friendship indeed"}]}],"literal":"Beauty-abundant having sweet-fruit yielding / capable-people's deeds virtuous will-become, / \"For people with kin, a support also it will be,\" thus / there I knew, O friend! The Kino tree's / unfailing soft branches, flowers to shed, the elephant / deep sleep snoring lord of the land's / chest-rightful became flawless friendship!","translation":"O friend! I have come to realize this: the deeds of capable people are always virtuous, and they serve as a support for those who have kin. Such is the flawless friendship, rightful to the chest of the lord of the land, where elephants sleep deeply and snore, while flowers shed from the unfailing, soft branches of the vēṅkai tree.","modern":"தோழியே! தகுதி உடையவர்கள் செய்யும் செயல்கள் அறநெறிப் பட்டதாகவே இருக்கும்; அது சுற்றத்தாரைக் கொண்ட மக்களுக்கு ஒரு பற்றுக்கோடாகவும் விளங்கும் என்பதை நான் இப்போது அறிந்து கொண்டேன். அழியாத மென்மையான கிளைகளை உடைய வேங்கை மரத்தின் மலர்கள் உதிர, யானையானது ஆழ்ந்த உறக்கத்தில் குறட்டை ஒலி எழுப்பும் மலைநாட்டினது தலைவனுடைய மார்பிற்கு உரியதான, குற்றமற்ற இந்த நட்பு அத்தகையதுதான்.","explanation":"The friend speaks to the heroine to reassure her about the hero's commitment and righteous nature. She states that she now understands that the actions of noble, capable people are always virtuous and serve as a protective support for their relatives. She compares this to the flawless friendship of the hero, which is rightful to his chest. The poem is set in the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape, where the image of the elephant sleeping deeply and snoring under the falling golden flowers of the vēṅkai tree represents peace, security, and trust. Just as the elephant sleeps without fear under the protective shade of the tree, the heroine can trust the hero's righteous nature and his protective love. Key words include 'வேங்கை' (Kino tree), 'யானை' (elephant), and 'மறுவில் நட்பு' (flawless friendship).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.62],[0.62,1.0],[1.0,1.47],[1.47,1.9],[1.9,2.6],[2.6,3.06],[3.06,3.4],[3.4,4.03],[4.03,4.87],[4.87,5.44],[5.53,5.76],[5.76,6.4],[6.4,7.21],[7.21,7.48],[7.48,7.66],[7.66,7.93],[7.93,8.11],[8.11,8.47],[8.47,8.74],[8.74,8.92],[8.92,9.2],[9.2,10.91],[10.91,12.2],[12.2,13.1],[13.25,13.7],[13.7,14.1],[14.1,14.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.85,1.0],[1.0,1.57],[1.57,2.0],[2.0,2.45],[2.45,2.9],[2.9,3.37],[3.37,3.9],[3.9,4.68],[4.68,6.04],[6.13,6.36],[6.36,6.92],[6.92,7.61],[7.61,7.86],[7.86,8.1],[8.1,9.4],[9.4,9.88],[9.88,10.82],[10.82,11.53],[11.53,12.0],[12.0,13.1],[13.1,13.7],[13.7,14.05],[14.05,14.87],[14.87,15.36],[15.36,16.01],[16.01,16.5]]},"sync":[[["எழில்","beauty"],["மிக","abundantly"]],[["உடைய","having"]],[["தீம்","sweet"],["கணி","Kino tree"]],[["படூஉம்","yielding"]],[["திறவோர்","capable people"]],[["செய்வி